## 🎮 Current AI Features

### 1. Intelligent Task Analysis
```json
POST /api/ai/analyze-task
{
  "task_title": "Build REST API",
  "task_description": "FastAPI backend with CRUD operations"
}

Response:
{
  "priority": "high",
  "estimated_hours": 16,
  "subtasks": [
    "Design database schema",
    "Set up FastAPI project",
    "Implement models with SQLAlchemy",
    "Create CRUD endpoints",
    "Add input validation",
    "Write unit tests",
    "Document API"
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Use Pydantic for validation",
    "Set up Alembic for migrations early"
  ],
  "challenges": [
    "Async database operations",
    "Proper error handling"
  ]
}
```

### 2. Smart Note Summarization
```json
POST /api/ai/summarize-note
{
  "note_content": "Long meeting notes...",
  "summary_length": "medium"
}

Response:
{
  "summary": "Concise summary...",
  "key_points": ["Point 1", "Point 2"],
  "tags_suggested": ["meeting", "planning"],
  "word_count": 450
}
```

### 3. Goal Planning with Strategy
```json
POST /api/ai/generate-goal-plan
{
  "goal_title": "Learn machine learning",
  "target_date": "2025-06-01",
  "current_skills": ["Python", "Math basics"]
}

Response:
{
  "milestones": [...],
  "actions": [...],
  "resources": ["Coursera ML course", "Kaggle"],
  "success_metrics": [...],
