-  Multi-model AI integration
-  Task analysis
-  Note summarization
- Goal planning
-  Basic authentication
-  PostgreSQL setup

### Phase 2: Agentic Behavior (Next 2 Months)
-  Multi-turn conversations with memory
-  Context-aware suggestions based on history
-  Autonomous task creation from goals
-  Proactive check-ins ("How's that feature going?")
- Learning from user corrections

### Phase 3: Multi-Agent System (3-4 Months)
-  Specialized agents (Task, Creative, Research)
-  Agent coordination and collaboration
-  Performance monitoring per agent
-  Dynamic agent selection

### Phase 4: RAG & Embeddings (4-6 Months)
-  Vector database integration (pgvector)
-  Semantic search across all user data
-  Personalized knowledge base
-  Context-aware document generation

### Phase 5: Advanced Features (6+ Months)
-  Voice interface
-  Calendar integration
-  Email integration
-  Team collaboration
-  Mobile apps
- Advanced analytics

